<p class="mb-2 text-xs tracking-[0.08em] text-muted-foreground uppercase">Svbase · Primitives</p>

# Checkbox Group

Grouped checkboxes with a mixed-state select-all parent.

<div class="mt-4 rounded-xl border bg-card p-6 text-card-foreground">
	<CheckboxGroup.Root bind:value={toppings} name="topping" allValues={['cheese', 'pepperoni']}>
		<div class="flex flex-col gap-2">
			<CheckboxGroup.Parent>All toppings</CheckboxGroup.Parent>
			<CheckboxGroup.Item value="cheese">Cheese</CheckboxGroup.Item>
			<CheckboxGroup.Item value="pepperoni">Pepperoni</CheckboxGroup.Item>
		</div>
	</CheckboxGroup.Root>
	<p class="mt-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground">Toppings: {toppings.length ? toppings.join(', ') : '—'}</p>
</div>

## Anatomy

<CodeBlock code={anatomy} filename="App.svelte" />

## API reference

### CheckboxGroup.Root

<ApiTable props={rootProps} />

`CheckboxGroup.Parent` checks or clears everything, showing mixed state for partial selection. `CheckboxGroup.Item` takes a unique `value`. Put `name` on the root only — one hidden input per selected value submits the group.

## Keyboard interactions

- <Kbd>Space</Kbd> toggles the focused box; <Kbd>Enter</Kbd> never toggles (it submits the form).
